Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 15:01:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] Runtime: platform support for Emscripten (wasm32)

- EE main memory at a fixed address of the wasm linear memory
- software CRC32C (wasm has no crc32 instruction)
- no ptrace debugger, no AVX requirement, emscripten thread names
- print u64 listener results with %lld (long is 32 bits on wasm32)
